WEBVTT

00:01:58.704 --> 00:02:03.579
can stimulate brain cells to release
mood-altering norepinephrine,

00:02:03.621 --> 00:02:06.079
dopamine, and serotonin.

00:02:06.663 --> 00:02:09.163
But getting to your brain cells is tricky,

00:02:09.204 --> 00:02:12.663
and amino acids have to compete
for limited access.

00:02:12.704 --> 00:02:15.079
A diet with a range of foods 
helps maintain

00:02:15.121 --> 00:02:17.163
a balanced combination
of brain messengers

00:02:17.204 --> 00:02:21.704
and keeps your mood from getting skewed
in one direction or the other.

00:02:22.413 --> 00:02:24.246
Like the other organs in our bodies,

00:02:24.288 --> 00:02:28.121
our brains also benefit from a steady
supply of micronutrients.

00:02:28.288 --> 00:02:30.913
Antioxidants in fruits and vegetables